n1WV0fPRSSc3ncCVnIcw2CzUqTYdXw_EfBk8wkQjrRjS0IKRpPmgVVfUR9YpLm1E8mKKOq66U\"]]],\"Bed Wars\",[\"4,3\",4.3109574],\"Action\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"EUR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Kaufen\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.sandboxol.indiegame.bedwar\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.sandboxol.indiegame.bedwar\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.sandboxol.indiegame.bedwar\"]],[\"qgJpGmcIAxImCiQKHmNvbS5zYW5kYm94b2wuaW5kaWVnYW1lLmJlZHdhchABGANKEwilus/L0dqXAxXvbYQGHZkUFiqaARMIutSctdHalwMV4l2EBh3qixXi+gEPCg0IABIJCgVkZS1ERRAB\"],[[[null,null,\"AuZJzu8mjNs\",[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AuZJzu8mjNs?vq\\u003dlarge\\u0026rel\\u003d0\\u0026autohide\\u003d1\\u0026showinfo\\u003d0\"],\"yt:movie:AuZJzu8mjNs\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmhYFAJe8gmMJXPZJ1qGJgIdqmbXtgtl2WKi7yeLqqCaigLRuq3qz7FVSVG9Q0091VuoOARzqO5-9oEd-v6flCLkFll0hOFTIYVGXYkl8UY_m0OsgQ1OEzdJEUKu7lrteG_UFb7EmbrtXYSOxDDV4nNFf4OOABD44oUmrXyuZ9PVcZ52Voh_OyjMc83K8A8q96LEfq4ynX-xr3LhecTzPWa4jo6HqX2E94Y195k0xeNV5xYOoxUZRULgmv4FsDacyf0Ur4RKuEVk94mS8guzZS5kEciLpSzsZ8OGPWvlJaHUg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AuZJzu8mjNs/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Bedwars is a teamwork PVP game, you will be battling your opponents on islands in the sky, protect your bed and try to destroy your opponents\\u0026#39; bed to prevent them from respawning, beat all the opponents to win the game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTeam Work⚔️\\u003cbr\\u003e16 players divided into 4 teams,spawning on different islands,build bridges with blocks to attack your opponents and contest the resources to upgrade your weapon and items so you can destroy your enemies\\u0026#39; beds more easily! Get matched in seconds to compete with players from all over the world, the challenger spots are waiting for you!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMultiple Modes🏰\\u003cbr\\u003eSolo, Duo, Quad three modes in different maps that are picked randomly, different styles, different tactics, no matter you are solo queueing or queueing with your friends you can get matched in second and enjoy the addicting and intense game pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVariety of Items💣\\u003cbr\\u003ePurchase different types of blocks, weapons, tools, firebomb, traps, and more items with the resources you collected, different ways and tactics to defeat your opponents for you to discover.；Melee, ranged, techniques with different items, the only limitation is your imagination!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLive-time Chat😎\\u003cbr\\u003eCan\\u0026#39;t find buddies to play together? Bedwars has built-in chat systems,identify your language automatically and match you into the correct channel so you can communicate with players who speak the same language as you to make more friends online!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCustom Avatar🎲\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomized skins for multiple categories, thousands of avatar skins for you to choose from, there will be always one option fit for you, present yourself with a unique look in the Bedwars!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you have any fund problem or suggestions please contact us via email.\\u003cbr\\u003ebgofficialcontact@sandboxol.com\"],\"Blockman GO studio\",\"100.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lP5gc93WuoCMHveW7uBBMpxNyUdofX-99XYlqU_HbyOq38hoiWlO8_ZJ8RL5rG7peyWrtCoLm__fPIj-augP7w\"],null,[171,240,249,255]],null,[\"USK ab 12 Jahren\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/R-TrFxpinaWjr37_CZ5GQk7NPeZIZyHcPAaW8wUutdyhiLJncPDZubgf7vJtPWaZN0r0_SPIfq_40cFFkg\"]],[null,\"Gewalt\"],[null,\"Chats und Onlinekäufe\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eWeitere Informationen\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,n