u attempt to prep your spaceship for departure, but beware as one will be an impostor bent on killing everyone!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCrewmates can win by completing all tasks or discovering and voting the impostor off the ship. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe Impostor can use sabotage to cause chaos, making for easier kills and better alibis.\"],\"Innersloth LLC\",\"500.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/25Y8L-QQMCS5gWgCnCFPirAm6W9oo7kXQOuoWlN2YW-7c6Y3UtQ8dhDFeiV4f1S8UCQz1kEp0agJrNw06rp9zg\"],null,[8,6,15,255]],null,[\"USK ab 6 Jahren\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8HPdf_L4Or-ku-j-kmUxJEwvGX6EHcrgeqTx-xvQGKCpqK-cFu5J8qLDRE4qUlPCVdd21MfZWWqxIWv1iKA\"]],[null,\"Angedeutete Gewalt\"],[null,\"Chats und Onlinekäufe\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eWeitere Informationen\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/z9D7ghLEH_YLU71JE65NeArDYb9E_Q3JpvXMoJtp1c7SVoDbWx9XCb96XYrjDMCl0Igaxd7a01JhpIrwsw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"EUR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Kaufen\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.innersloth.spacemafia\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.innersloth.spacemafia\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Installieren\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"1,09 €–24,99 € bei Abrechnung über Google Play\",[false]]],[[\"com.studio27.MelonPlayground\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-PN9HnSlvjo7DXe-TQntLMSev2vlw8PSckRW6Vk2m81_AnTZ2XsWa3bkJ7qfGk3fHaI46OGI_3hqJ8ia7InHUH4\"],null,[3,44,123,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\