oogle.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.netease.newspike\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.netease.newspike\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.netease.newspike\"]],[\"qgJfGl0IBxIcChoKFGNvbS5uZXRlYXNlLm5ld3NwaWtlEAEYA0oTCKW6z8vR2pcDFe9thAYdmRQWKpoBEwi61Jy10dqXAxXiXYQGHeqLFeL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWRlLURFEAE\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"G6lRRFY55Pw\",[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/G6lRRFY55Pw?vq\\u003dlarge\\u0026rel\\u003d0\\u0026autohide\\u003d1\\u0026showinfo\\u003d0\"],\"yt:movie:G6lRRFY55Pw\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezk0a-XzW4DDIHc_ornSor9NfUnuxpjV3h8mWs2EpvYwDXMlMpiTjsuA7s6q4K3pe-4QNc315751MIBRbNDwa9V00NQyDFoj1LUYNMobxwXlknh9OiPTiuQhi44cxXbyyDqTzXB9g0Q__P4e7zD-u2Dirl_TTKyisKu34LZ-jWLbUuhs5dSBGDx8T4TXbQps00iF_boyrN87Ij5FFYUCWS_YhMUpyps6IRCHkBeVakPKPN8uX7maPPUtuXFnjG6IKgMbNMT8PX1wNMnpQp5cH-j1gHBED0LvKgIIdMJFHgnMSA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/G6lRRFY55Pw/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"[New Gameplay: Nightmare Trial]\\u003cbr\\u003e1. The all-new Nightmare Trial gameplay and nighttime Shutter Island are coming to War Tide! Join the Trial and enjoy the hunt!\\u003cbr\\u003e2. Searching or fighting will earn you Giggle Coins! The Clown will reward players who rank high in Giggle Coins.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Benefits Event]\\u003cbr\\u003e[Halloween Rally Rewards]: The all-new weapon skin Spear - Blossom, featuring an exclusive reload animation, is here! Invite friends to join the event, rally your squad, and claim this new gun skin for free!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBlood Strike is a battle royale game available on multiple platforms. With its fast-paced matches, smooth optimization and characters with distinctive abilities, the game has won the hearts of nearly 100 million players globally.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the players worldwide in redefining tactical combat NOW!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e【Well optimized, Any Device】\\u003cbr\\u003eSilky controls meet HD visuals! Master mobile-native moves like recoil control and slide-shoot combos. Feel next-gen precision on any device – victory flows through your fingertips! Your skills, not specs, define victory.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e【No fixed roles, Every Player is the Carry】\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild your dream squad! Switch between more than 15 Strikers, customize 30+ weapon and remix them (Dual UZI? Yes!). Squad up and rewrite battle royale rules!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e【4 CORE MODES, INFINITE THRILLS】\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy our thrilled Battle Royale, Squad Fight, Hot Zone or Weapon Master modes and limited time ones. Infinite respawn until the last minutes. No camping, just heart-pounding gunfights. Your highlight reel starts NOW!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now and drop into the arena!\\u003cbr\\u003e__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow Us\\u003cbr\\u003eX：https://twitter.com/bloodstrike_EN \\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook：https://www.facebook.com/OfficialBloodStrikeNetEase \\u003cbr\\u003eInstagram：https://www.instagram.com/bloodstrike_official/ \\u003cbr\\u003eTikTok：https://www.tiktok.com/@bloodstrikeofficial \\u003cbr\\u003eYouTube：https://www.youtube.com/@bloodstrike_official\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin our Discord server:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://discord.gg/bloodstrike\"],\"NetEase Games\",\"100.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aetN-iBnS2yTnt3sn7imiV9sg0biVx0f8G35s0KGwdRmgYLRJdHe8JIe8RRj-Clt5_z6SaPjB9-fyyo1vT9O\"],null,[78,81,112,255]],null,[\"USK ab 16 Jahren\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cq-61uX75JlSRyeihENPRwZbTXESpJAyyMqYwWrHbcnkW3FNbVnjNSEi1-7i3nG3ErpZWLS5AOH_Bq5P\"]],[null,\"Erhöhte Kaufanreize und Gewalt\"],[null,\"Chats und Käu