Yb3pNsUwboW7v5K2qqbFaHCIY0iaTaE-aYM-X_ew\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oAABmhJweKs/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Spider Fighter 3 is an open-world action game. You play Strider — a superhero \\u003cbr\\u003ewith spider powers, fighting street crime across the city. Swing on ropes and webs, \\u003cbr\\u003eland on rooftops, and battle the gangs running the streets below.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGAMEPLAY\\u003cbr\\u003e- Web swing, flying and water-gliding\\u003cbr\\u003e- Melee combat with combos and heavy attacks\\u003cbr\\u003e- Web abilities: pull enemies in, tie them up, break their guard\\u003cbr\\u003e- Wall run, free climb, and dive off skyscrapers\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHEROES AND SKINS\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock a roster of playable heroes, each with their own skills, gadgets and \\u003cbr\\u003eskins. Swap between them, level them up, and build the squad that fits your \\u003cbr\\u003eplaystyle.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSTORY MISSIONS\\u003cbr\\u003eClear missions across the city. Break up robberies, stop armed gangs, chase \\u003cbr\\u003edown cars, and battle the crime bosses who run each district. Clean up one area, \\u003cbr\\u003eunlock the next.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOPEN WORLD SANDBOX\\u003cbr\\u003eBetween missions the city is yours. Free roam the sandbox, hunt collectibles, \\u003cbr\\u003etake side missions, race across rooftops, or fly through the streets looking for \\u003cbr\\u003etrouble. Random crimes spawn as you go — respond, or ignore them.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBOSS BATTLES\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery district ends with a villain. Learn the pattern, dodge, hit back. Some \\u003cbr\\u003efight dirty. Beat them all and the city is yours.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSUITS AND UPGRADES\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock suits as you progress. Each one changes how Strider looks and fights — \\u003cbr\\u003emore damage, faster swing, tougher in close combat. Upgrade your abilities: \\u003cbr\\u003estronger punches, longer web range, faster recovery.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWHAT YOU GET\\u003cbr\\u003e- Open-world superhero action adventure, free to play\\u003cbr\\u003e- Rope and web swinging, rooftop flying\\u003cbr\\u003e- Hand-to-hand and web-based fighting\\u003cbr\\u003e- Unlockable suits and a full upgrade tree\"],\"Starplay FZCO\",\"100.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/F_mmPkMveiTiW92SglQI2OKNlz8b1yFt2ZbMw9gbYVuCbmEqfEBeiAHcUqdZB31PH7BafVeZFwE_8Aw2AfiEFQ\"],null,[118,118,118,255]],null,[\"USK ab 12 Jahren\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/R-TrFxpinaWjr37_CZ5GQk7NPeZIZyHcPAaW8wUutdyhiLJncPDZubgf7vJtPWaZN0r0_SPIfq_40cFFkg\"]],[null,\"Erhöhte Kaufanreize und Gewalt\"],[null,\"Käufe im Spiel (enthält Zufallsartikel)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eWeitere Informationen\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JyiZb7TsaZcHgss7HOlBnkfmLBh-MLN_11Hdn8483VGxoEBp7aQwNhnho4jTgJ4Yo53Z7VVARewJbQmZZg\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"EUR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Kaufen\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.starplay.spider.fighter.openworld\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.starplay.spider.fighter.openworld\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Installieren\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"1,19 €–164,99 € bei Abrechnung über Google Play\",[false]]],[[\"com.ta.strike.ops\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/eiOZd_w3-KqGU1NfuZDqrY8FclcKAdGegweEXsNcjBWPs9yWffAY78PCITk1wj9vtEdM0S3DuKdoXiqUF1o_\"],null,[224,194,138,255],null,null,null,2