QW6o4qdfrMeZ4VkMWgayVkXe3-pPO3_TWeudQms9HR1kQ6DJDhHPSFXhNFGaCJ5WaPew6G8Fa7ncTAc5BnaJNnK1B5NVkfNXQvlswGO09qqM38XlPjQ1-76etGKYjYV58aZRCSvMPF_ZFDZSwzJFtzDoM3sBEIHyQZmI3VVOC4gyfxGWNg2K4j0gC5KGQkr6beVOC768qmN31o2lpOVOlzIh62UXCajlPbynoubkulz5HSa6jBAjS_unkdvB17z3awnFuT128jQiXj5m70FSOu8ID3yyFacyzg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kAo4rc_GQg4/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eIf you like play Multiplayer (MP)  PvP Offline Shooter and to be a sniper. Here is for you, the latest of Team Deathmatch shooting game ! The combat is real, and you can be the hero. \\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🔫Ready. Aim. Fire! \\u003c/b\\u003e This is the #1 realistic 3D team PvP game available on Google Play. You are a well trained elite member of special weapons and tactics teams. Equipped with sub-machine guns, sniper rifles and stun grenades, you will navigate secret missions across the globe to eradicate the evil syndicate that stands in the way of a peaceful world. It is time to load out your firearms! Leave no squad mate behind in this action oriented first person shooter game! Let the bullets fly now! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003d\\u003d\\u003dGame Features\\u003d\\u003d\\u003d\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Lots of perfect maps to get Best FPS Shooting Experience Ever.\\u003cbr\\u003e★ 20+ Weapons, Customize Your Exclusive Weapons and Skins! \\u003cbr\\u003e(MAC10,TMP,MP5,UMP, P90, Galil, FAMAS, AK47, M4A1,SG-552, AUG,M249-SAW,SG-550,AWP... )\\u003cbr\\u003e★Customize your weapon and get a unique skins to be cool Multiplayer FPS player.\\u003cbr\\u003e★Detailed Snipers for shooters who like to be a sniper.\\u003cbr\\u003e★Death Match: It\\u0026#39;s kill or be killed, is the way of the gun!.\\u003cbr\\u003e★Team Death Match: Team vs Team fight, who will be the last team standing on the arena?\\u003cbr\\u003e★Completely offline that you can play everywhere and any time\\u003cbr\\u003e★Perfect optimization even for weak devices!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eAre you ready?\\u003c/b\\u003e Test out your shooting skills in this exciting fast-paced shooting game! Experience action, where fast reflexes and TACTICAL skills are essential to success. Be the best shooter in every beautifully crafted maps!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eSUPPORT\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe\\u0026#39;re grateful for any and all feedback and suggestions on the project.😊😊\"],\"FPS Shooter \\u0026 Action Game\",\"100.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/F-PA6T3XIdvwrse23SaIC08Gy3t6F6Nx5tuza8AEM89mSB_3hZnRkP-4JMv6yjDGOiGDeAmq12oHYveiRbSdFw\"],null,[235,231,220,255]],null,[\"USK ab 16 Jahren\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cq-61uX75JlSRyeihENPRwZbTXESpJAyyMqYwWrHbcnkW3FNbVnjNSEi1-7i3nG3ErpZWLS5AOH_Bq5P\"]],[null,\"Erhöhte Kaufanreize und Gewalt\"],[null,\"Käufe im Spiel (enthält Zufallsartikel)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eWeitere Informationen\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pjLkbdMr3lglyi9KcI6G6fW9kIS_Jq0hndGKRLnFtEzPP6-xH6j_W_Qn-z5qeJRoudfL7gK6BuTrkE-3mcU\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"EUR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Kaufen\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.ta.strike.ops\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.ta.strike.ops\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Installieren\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"0,99 €–109,99 € bei Abrechnung über Google Play\",[false]]],[[\"jp.co.ponos.battlecatsen\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.goo